---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import reference from "../assets/images/pine-pavilion-after-rain.avif";
---

<figure class="painting-reference">
  <a href={reference.src} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open Pine Pavilion after Rain reference image at full size (new tab)">
    <Image
      src={reference}
      alt="Ink landscape on ivory paper: a leaning pine and small pavilion beside a stream, rocky banks and layered mountains fading into mist."
      widths={[480, 768, 1024]}
      sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 480px"
    />
  </a>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Pine Pavilion after Rain</strong> · Shared painting reference<br />
    An original AI-generated teaching image inspired by Tang Yin, not a historical
    work or an authenticated painting by him. Study the pine, rock textures and
    mist washes. <a href={reference.src} download="pine-pavilion-after-rain.avif">Download the reference</a>.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .painting-reference {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .painting-reference img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 30rem;
    height: auto;
  }

  .painting-reference figcaption {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
